# Basic Performance Optimization

## Image Optimization (Biggest Win)
```tsx
import Image from 'next/image'

<Image
  src="/images/hero.webp"
  alt="Description"
  width={1200}
  height={800}
  priority  // Only for above-the-fold images
/>

// For grid: priority on first 2-3 items only
<Image priority={index < 3} />
```

## Convert Images to WebP Before Adding
```bash
npx sharp-cli --input images/*.png --output images/ --format webp --quality 80
```

## Font Optimization
- Use `next/font/google` for Inter, Open Sans (self-hosts, zero CLS)
- Use `next/font/local` for EudoxusSans
- NEVER link to fonts.googleapis.com directly
- Always set `display: 'swap'`
- Consider subsetting EudoxusSans if only Latin is needed

## CSS Optimization
```bash
# Remove unused Webflow base styles (project CSS is ~141KB)
npx purgecss --css styles/webflow.css --content webflow-source/*.html --output styles/webflow-purged.css

# Minify
npx cssnano styles/webflow-purged.css styles/webflow.min.css
```

## JavaScript Optimization
- Load webflow.js with `strategy="lazyOnload"`
- Remove unused Webflow.define() modules from webflow.js
- Code-split heavy components with `next/dynamic`

```tsx
import dynamic from 'next/dynamic'

const HeavyComponent = dynamic(() => import('./HeavyComponent'), {
  loading: () => <div className="animate-pulse bg-gray-200 h-64 rounded" />,
  ssr: false,
})
```

## Add width/height to ALL Images
Missing dimensions = CLS (layout shift). Always explicit:
```html
<!-- Causes layout shift -->
<img src="photo.jpg" />

<!-- No layout shift -->
<img src="photo.jpg" width="800" height="600" alt="..." />
```
